{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在尖沙咀河內道發現一名昏迷男子，當場證實不治，並以涉嫌非法搬移屍體，拘捕一名男子。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是河內道一幢商廈外。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yDEmhLlQX31790203012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方在凌晨約1時半接獲報案，指有人在街上昏倒。警方到場發現該名男子，被放在椅上。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wRtKH4glaV1790202997.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BODY-0430_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後拘捕一名28歲男子，據了解他是酒吧職員，在酒吧廁所發現事主昏迷後，與另一名女子將事主搬到K11外的電單車位，該女子正被通緝。消息指，警方在酒吧檢獲一個懷疑冰壺，未知是否屬於死者。死者身上無發現明顯針孔。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T02:20:05.372656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}